sequenceDiagram
    participant DRV as XSpace Driver
    participant CMD as Command Parser
    participant LIFE as Lifecycle Manager
    participant SDKB as SDK Bridge
    participant SDK as claude_agent_sdk
    participant TRANS as Message Translator
    participant OUT as Output Writer

    Note over DRV: 用户在 UI 点 停止
    DRV->>CMD: stdin: interrupt{threadId}
    CMD->>LIFE: dispatch interrupt
    LIFE->>SDKB: client.interrupt()
    SDKB->>SDK: 触发中断
    SDK->>SDK: 终止当前 run
    SDK-->>SDKB: ResultMessage(stop_reason=interrupted)
    SDKB->>TRANS: dispatch ResultMessage
    TRANS->>TRANS: 识别 stop_reason=interrupted
    TRANS->>OUT: claude_run_interrupted{reason}
    OUT-->>DRV: 终态事件
    Note over DRV: UI 显示 已停止 (不是失败)
